0..78 Comment "// Static β at one classifier, the type operators `Type -> Type`: an operator"
79..157 Comment "// applied in a signature reduces before the kernel reads the declaration, and"
158..230 Comment "// the run never sees it. `sum` takes a pair whose type is `apply(twice,"
231..306 Comment "// Integer)`, two static applications deep; `doubled` returns one. Implicit"
307..387 Comment "// parameters `@[…]`, the telescope a use would supply by name, are refused by"
388..455 Comment "// name at their declaration (`ImplicitTelescope`), which no corpus"
456..488 Comment "// expectation can state (#526)."
